<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: passive acoustic radar -->
  <DMSE_AcousticEarlyWarningRadar.label>被動聲學雷達</DMSE_AcousticEarlyWarningRadar.label>
  <!-- EN: A concrete acoustic mirror that listens for distant engine noise. It needs no power and emits nothing, so anti-radiation missiles cannot find it. Its warnings come early but are vague, and it struggles to hear fast or stealthy targets.\n\nDetects incoming threats only, and cannot guide interceptors. -->
  <DMSE_AcousticEarlyWarningRadar.description>一座用來收集遠方引擎聲的混凝土聲學反射鏡。不需要電力、也不發出任何訊號，反輻射導彈找不到它。預警來得早但很模糊，也很難聽見高速或匿蹤目標。\n\n只能偵測來襲目標，無法導引攔截彈。</DMSE_AcousticEarlyWarningRadar.description>
  
</LanguageData>